        "fp_trap": "Everything the rule looks for is really there: a principal the gateway rule has never seen, calling a production model directly, with no gateway row and no token limit. What makes it benign is outside the record: an approved change ticket that names this role, this address and this week, and a normal sign-in just before the calls began.",
